Style the elements to make them look like a circular slider.

```css
/* styles.css */
.slider-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    margin: auto;
}

#circularSlider {
    display: none; /* Hide the default range input */
}

.circle {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #ccc;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.concentric-circles {
